EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hello, hello, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I keep bumping into you. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Just can't
say no to the snow, right?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehi, ciaaao, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Continuiamo a incontrarci oggi, eh?
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Anche tu vai pazz{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} per la neve?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Selam selam, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Durmadan sana rastlıyorum. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Kara hayır
diyemiyorsun, değil mi?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}G-g-good morning again{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I still can't believe how chilly it is
this morning, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}B-b-buongiorno di nuovo{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Si gela di freddo stamattina,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Balliamo un po' per scaldarci?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}G-g-günaydın yine{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bu sabahın hâlâ bu kadar soğuk olduğuna
inanamıyorum, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh! It's you again, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Still running around in all this
super-fun snow, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Tú otra vez, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No te cansas de corretear por la
nieve, ¿eh? ¡Como yo, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh! Sei ancora tu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ancora in giro, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
La neve è da urlooo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah! Yine sensin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bu süper eğlenceli karın içinde hâlâ
koşturuyor musun, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}G-g-good evening again{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's so cold that I should go inside,
but I can't stop loving up the snow!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ancora tu! B-b-buona sera{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Con 'sto freddo dovrei restarmene
a casa, ma la neve è stratosferica!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}İ-i-iyi akşamlar yine{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
İçeri girmem gerekecek kadar soğuk
ama bu kara bayılmayı bırakamıyorum!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bello quando nevica di sera!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non sei d'accordo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?
